Step 2: Create @Bean in main class and implement PlatformTransactionManager.

Step 3: write @Transactional over your logic method available inside @service

Step 4: if we are using spring boot then no need to add any external library,
        it uses (spring-boot-starter-data-jpa), and this is already available in spring boot.


Dirt-Read
==========
1. Dirty Read — Uncommitted Data Read Karna
    jab Transaction 1 ka uncommitted data, Transaction 2 read kar leta hai aur baad mein Transaction 1 rollback ho jata hai, use Dirty Read kehte hain.


2. Phantom Read — Query Dobara Execute Karne Par Extra Rows Milna
    Ek transaction same query dobara execute karta hai aur usse matching rows ka set badla hua milta hai.





